nce, and clean component design. I learn fastest by shipping small projects, reviewing my code, and asking for feedback early."]},skills:{heading:"Skills & Technologies",description:"The tools I use daily to design, build, and ship web applications.",groups:[{title:"Frontend",items:["React","TypeScript","Tailwind CSS","HTML & CSS","Figma"]},{title:"Backend",items:["Node.js","Express.js","MongoDB","REST APIs"]},{title:"Tools & Languages",items:["JavaScript","Python","Git","Vite"]}]},projects:{heading:"Selected Projects",description:"Three individual projects that show how I approach design, data, and code quality.",items:[{id:"taskflow",title:"TaskFlow",summary:"A modern productivity application that helps users organize tasks, manage priorities, and track daily progress.",category:"Frontend",tags:["React","TypeScript","Tailwind CSS","Local Storage"],features:["Kanban task board","Priority indicators","Progress tracking"],accent:"orange",icon:"board",thumbnail:{src:"/images/projects/image.png",alt:"TaskFlow Kanban board with To Do, In Progress, and Done columns"}},{id:"weatherwise",title:"WeatherWise",summary:"A beautiful, responsive weather application that helps users explore weather conditions and forecasts for different cities.",category:"Frontend",tags:["React","JavaScript","CSS","REST APIs"],features:["City search","Five-day forecast","Humidity and wind details"],accent:"cyan",icon:"chart",thumbnail:{src:"/images/projects/image copy.png",alt:"WeatherWise dashboard with a current temperature and five-day forecast"}},{id:"studyhub",title:"StudyHub",summary:"A student-focused learning platform for managing study resources, monitoring learning progress, and organizing academic goals.",category:"Full-Stack",tags:["React","Node.js","Express","MongoDB"],features:["Course dashboard","Study resource cards","Learning progress indicators"],accent:"coral",icon:"notes",thumbnail:{src:"/images/projects/image copy 2.png",alt:"StudyHub course dashboard with progress bars and a calendar"}}]},journey:{heading:"Learning Journey",description:"How my path from first lines of code to full-stack development has unfolded.",items:[{period:"Year 1",title:"Started Computer Science",description:"Began with C and Python, building small command-line tools to understand how programs work."},{period:"Year 2",title:"Discovered Frontend Development",description:"Built my first React projects and fell in love with interface craft, responsiveness, and accessibility."},{period:"Year 3",title:"Full-Stack Foundations",description:"Learned Node.js, Express, and MongoDB, and shipped my first end-to-end application."},{period:"Now",title:"Building in Production Mode",description:"Focusing on maintainable architecture, thorough testing, and polished user experiences."}]},achievements:{heading:"Individual Achievements",description:"Personal milestones from my recent work. These are sample entries for demonstration.",items:[{title:"Shipped Three Complete Projects",description:"Designed, built, and documented three end-to-end web applications from idea to working prototype."},{title:"Accessibility-First Redesign",description:"Audited a personal project and improved keyboard navigation, focus states, and text contrast."},{title:"Consistent Build Habit",description:"Maintained a steady practice of weekly commits and small, reviewable pull requests."}]},contact:{heading:"Let's Connect",description:"Have a question, an internship opportunity, or a project idea? Send me a message and I will get back to you.",email:"aarav.sharma@example.com"}},gl=[{projectId:"campusconnect",tagline:"Campus events, registrations, and community updates in one place.",members:[{memberId:"aarav",focus:"frontend",responsibility:"Frontend & UI/UX",keyContributions:["Designed the event discovery interface.","Built reusable React event cards and registration UI components.","Improved responsive layouts and accessibility."],technologies:["React","TypeScript","Tailwind CSS","Figma"]},{memberId:"priya",focus:"backend",responsibility:"Backend & Database",keyContributions:["Designed REST API prototypes for events and registrations.","Created MongoDB data models.","Implemented validation and API error-handling patterns."],technologies:["Node.js","Express.js","MongoDB","Postman"]},{memberId:"rohan",focus:"integration",responsibility:"Integration & Coordination",keyContributions:["Connected frontend interfaces with API prototypes.","Coordinated task assignments and Git workflows.","Tested event registration interactions."],technologies:["JavaScript","React","Git","REST APIs"]}]},{projectId:"ecotrack",tagline:"Sustainability dashboard turning everyday habits into clear, goal-driven progress.",members:[{memberId:"aarav",focus:"frontend",responsibility:"Dashboard UI",keyContributions:["Designed sustainability data cards and responsive layouts.","Built reusable chart containers.","Improved dashboard usability."],technologies:["React","Tailwind CSS","Figma"]},{memberId:"priya",focus:"backend",responsibility:"Data Processing",keyContributions:["Designed data-handling logic for environmental metrics.","Created sample API response structures.","Validated sustainability tracking inputs."],technologies:["Python","Node.js","JavaScript"]},{memberId:"rohan",focus:"integration",responsibility:"Full-Stack Integration",keyContributions:["Integrated dashboard components with application state.","Implemented goal-tracking interactions.","Coordinated testing and feature integration."],technologies:["React","JavaScript","Git"]}]},{projectId:"collabboard",tagline:"A Kanban-style task board for organizing team work and tracking status.",members:[{memberId:"aarav",focus:"frontend",responsibility:"Kanban Interface",keyContributions:["Designed task cards and interactive boards.","Built responsive project dashboards.","Implemented visual task status indicators."],technologies:["React","TypeScript","Tailwind CSS"]},{memberId:"priya",focus:"backend",responsibility:"Task APIs & Data Modeling",keyContributions:["Designed API endpoints for task management.","Created task and user data models.","Added validation and error-handling patterns."],technologies:["Node.js","Express.js","MongoDB"]},{memberId:"rohan",focus:"integration",responsibility:"Application Integration",keyContributions:["Integrated frontend and backend workflows.","Implemented task assignment and status interactions.","Coordinated Git-based collaboration."],technologies:["React","JavaScript","Node.js","Git"]}]}];function Tl(o){return gl.flatMap(({projectId:n,tagline:s,members:a})=>a.filter(l=>l.memberId===o).map(l=>({projectId:n,tagline:s,contribution:l})))}function nl(o){return Tl(o).map(({projectId:n,contribution:s})=>({source:"team",projectId:n,contribution:s.keyContributions[0]}))}const ft={mode:"team",name:"CodeNova",download:{label:"Download Team Profile",href:"/resume-codenova-team-profile.pdf",fileName:"CodeNova-Team-Profile.pdf"},hero:{availability:"Accepting hackathon and workshop collaborations",headline:[[{text:"We're "},{text:"CodeNova",highlight:!0},{text:" 🚀"}],[{text:"Turning Ideas Into "},{text:"Experiences",highlight:!0},{text:"."}]],subtitle:"Creative Minds. Clean Code. Real Impact.",intro:"We're a team of passionate student developers who collaborate to build meaningful digital experiences. From intuitive interfaces to scalable backend solutions, we transform ideas into functional applications.",primaryCta:{label:"Explore Our Projects",href:"#projects"},secondaryCta:{label:"Collaborate With Us",href:"#contact"},images:[{profileKey:"team-aarav",alt:"Portrait of Aarav Sharma, team member",defaultAvatarIndex:0},{profileKey:"team-priya",alt:"Portrait of Priya Verma, team member",defaultAvatarIndex:1},{profileKey:"team-rohan",alt:"Portrait of Rohan Mehta, team member",defaultAvatarIndex:2}]},about:{heading:"About CodeNova",paragraphs:["CodeNova brings together three student developers with complementary strengths. We split work by strength, review each other’s code, and ship projects that are easy to maintain.","Our workflow is built on Git branches, peer code reviews, and clear weekly milestones, so every project moves from sketch to working prototype with a shared sense of quality."]},skills:{heading:"Team Stack",description:"The combined technologies and workflow tools the team uses across projects.",groups:[{title:"Frontend",items:["React","TypeScript","Tailwind CSS","Figma"]},{title:"Backend",items:["Node.js","Express.js","MongoDB","REST APIs"]},{title:"Workflow",items:["JavaScript","Python","Git","Peer Code Reviews"]}]},projects:{heading:"Team Projects",description:"Three collaborative prototypes built by CodeNova. All projects are fictional samples.",items:[{id:"campusconnect",title:"CampusConnect",summary:"A college event and student community platform for discovering events and joining campus life.",category:"Full-Stack",tags:["React","Node.js","Express","MongoDB"],features:["Event discovery","Registration interface","Community announcements"],accent:"orange",icon:"calendar",thumbnail:{src:"/images/projects/image copy 3.png",alt:"CampusConnect event platform with featured events and a community feed"}},{id:"ecotrack",title:"EcoTrack",summary:"A sustainability dashboard that helps students visualize environmental habits and track personal goals.",category:"Frontend",tags:["React","JavaScript","Tailwind CSS"],features:["Interactive charts","Sustainability goals","Progress tracking"],accent:"teal",icon:"leaf",thumbnail:{src:"/images/projects/image copy 4.png",alt:"EcoTrack sustainability dashboard with green progress charts and goal cards"}},{id:"collabboard",title:"CollabBoard",summary:"A collaborative task management concept that helps student teams organize work and own responsibilities.",category:"Full-Stack",tags:["React","TypeScript","Node.js","MongoDB"],features:["Task organization","Team responsibilities","Project status tracking"],accent:"cyan",icon:"board",thumbnail:{src:"/images/projects/image copy 5.png",alt:"CollabBoard Kanban board with team avatars, task status tags, and a progress sidebar"}}]},achievements:{heading:"Team Milestones",description:"Clearly labeled sample milestones that reflect how CodeNova works together.",items:[{title:"College Hackathon Participation",description:"Participated in a 24-hour college hackathon and presented a working application prototype."},{title:"Collaborative Project Showcase",description:"Demonstrated a full-stack academic project during a college technical showcase."},{title:"Team Development Milestone",description:"Completed three collaborative project prototypes using Git-based version control and peer code reviews."}]},team:{heading:"Meet Our Team",description:"Three developers with complementary strengths, working as one team.",quickSummary:"Three student developers who split work by strength, review each other’s code, and ship maintainable projects.",topSkills:["React","TypeScript","Node.js","Express.js","MongoDB","Git"],members:[{id:"aarav",slug:"aarav-sharma",name:"Aarav Sharma",role:"Frontend Developer & UI/UX Lead",bio:"Passionate about creating accessible, responsive, and visually engaging user interfaces.",accent:"blue",avatar:{profileKey:"team-aarav",alt:"Portrait of Aarav Sharma",defaultAvatarIndex:0},skills:["React","TypeScript","Tailwind CSS","Figma"],socials:[{label:"GitHub (sample)",href:"#experience"},{label:"LinkedIn (sample)",href:"#experience"}]},{id:"priya",slug:"priya-verma",name:"Priya Verma",role:"Backend Developer",bio:"Focused on designing reliable APIs, managing databases, and developing maintainable backend systems.",accent:"orange",avatar:{profileKey:"team-priya",alt:"Portrait of Priya Verma",defaultAvatarIndex:1},skills:["Node.js","Express.js","MongoDB","REST APIs"],socials:[{label:"GitHub (sample)",href:"#experience"},{label:"LinkedIn (sample)",href:"#experience"}]},{id:"rohan",slug:"rohan-mehta",name:"Rohan Mehta",role:"Full-Stack Developer & Team Coordinator",bio:"Enjoys connecting frontend and backend systems while coordinating collaborative development.",accent:"teal",avatar:{profileKey:"team-rohan",alt:"Portrait of Rohan Mehta",defaultAvatarIndex:2},skills:["JavaScript","React","Python","Git"],socials:[{label:"GitHub (sample)",href:"#experience"},{label:"LinkedIn (sample)",href:"#experience"}]}]},contact:{heading:"Let's Collaborate",description:"Interested in a joint project, a hackathon team, or a workshop? Send CodeNova a message and our team will reply.",email:"codenova.team@example.com"}},Pl={aarav:{location:"India",quickSummary:"Computer Science student building responsive, accessible React interfaces and reusable component systems.",topSkills:["React","TypeScript","JavaScript","Tailwind CSS","HTML & CSS","Figma"],email:"aarav.sharma@example.com",status:"Open to Learning & Collaboration",about:{paragraphs:["I'm a Computer Science student passionate about creating modern, responsive, and user-friendly web applications. I enjoy combining visual design with clean, maintainable code to build intuitive digital experiences.","My primary interests include frontend engineering, UI/UX design, and accessibility."],highlights:[{label:"Educational background",text:"Undergraduate Computer Science student (sample details)."},{label:"Technical interests",text:"Frontend engineering, component design, and web accessibility."},{label:"Development philosophy",text:"Interfaces should feel obvious. I build reusable, readable components that a teammate can change without fear."},{label:"Problem-solving approach",text:"I start from the user goal, sketch the screen, build the smallest working version, then refine it with feedback."},{label:"Career aspirations",text:"To work as a frontend engineer on products where design quality and accessibility matter."}]},experience:[{period:"2023",title:"Frontend Development Foundations",context:"Course labs and self-study (sample)",contributions:["Learned HTML, CSS, and JavaScript fundamentals.","Built responsive pages and interactive UI componen